# Red Octopus AI — free AI providers (optional).
#
# The bot works fully offline WITHOUT any key (local brain).
# For ChatGPT-like answers, add one or more FREE API keys below.
# Pollinations needs NO key at all — it works out of the box.
# Create your OWN keys (never use anyone else's) and never commit
# this file to GitHub.
#
# 1. Groq (fast, free tier, no card) — key at https://console.groq.com/keys
# GROQ_API_KEY=your_own_key_here
#
# 2. OpenRouter (300+ models, free :free models) — key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_own_key_here
#
# 3. Mistral (free experiment tier) — key at https://console.mistral.ai/api-keys
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=your_own_key_here
#
# 4. NVIDIA NIM (free tier, no card) — key at https://build.nvidia.com
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=your_own_key_here
#
# 5. Pollinations — no key needed. Works immediately, free anonymous lane.
#
# Optional: change the try order (default: groq, openrouter, mistral,
# nvidia, pollinations) or pin one provider:
# OCTO_LLM_ORDER=pollinations,groq
# OCTO_LLM_PROVIDER=groq
#
# Optional: change a provider's model:
# OCTO_GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
# OCTO_OPENROUTER_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-r1:free
# OCTO_MISTRAL_MODEL=mistral-small-latest
# OCTO_NVIDIA_MODEL=meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct
# OCTO_POLLINATIONS_MODEL=gpt-oss-20b
